    3FF and >r  swap 0A lshift r> + swap  ( acc a )  again ;                    \ otherwise, assume prefix instructions         decimal                                                                                                                         -->                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             ( Multitasking 1/2 ____________________________________________ 10/9/26 BNE )                                                   :noname     ( next a -- )   drop u! ; constant asleep                           \ xt of sleeping task                           : pause     ( -- next a | ) [ _user ,inst ] a if @a+ @a+ >r a exit then ;       \ skip to the next task, or nothing if no task  : stop      ( -- )          asleep [ _user 1 + ,inst ] !a pause ;               \ stop the current task                         :noname     ( next a -- )                                                                                                           a! u! task[ dup !a                 ( ix r:d |R: ra ? \ save current r:d )   \ saves the current task's stack window             [ _user 2 + ,inst ] @a ]task r> drop drop                                   \ and loads the next task's stack window        ; constant awake                                                                \ xt of awake task                                                                                                                                                              hex _idata variable stackused  300030 stackused !   ( reserved for terminal )   